		{ "b", "|cffffd200Style, per ring: Full|r (the radial wheel) |cffffd200or Compact|r (like the game's radial flyout, the aura and stance picker). A Compact ring opens on the crossbar button that holds it, with that button's icon and its modifier glyphs in the middle.", 1 },
		{ "h", "Keyboard" },
		{ "b", "|cffffd200Chat goes out through the addon's own secure button.|r The game's chat box is never written to. After a send the chat box stays open and empty; one more Circle closes it.", 1 },
		{ "b", "|cffffd200Chat Style no longer matters:|r Send works with Classic and IM.", 1 },
