		{ "b", "Words are learned only from chat you send.", 1 },
		{ "b", "|cffffd200Simpler Keyboard tab:|r On, Open, Layout, Scale and Word suggestions. The buttons can no longer be rebound, and the keyboard always places itself.", 1 },
		{ "b", "|cffffd200Quick messages|r is now a page with two columns: the situations on the left, their lines on the right. Built-in lines can be hidden one by one (Square), and |cffffd200Restore|r brings them back.", 1 },
		{ "b", "In the quick message editor, the suggestion list shows the fill-ins such as {target} with what each gives right now.", 1 },
		{ "b", "Fixed: Compact showed empty keys instead of each set's letters.", 1 },
		{ "h", "Settings" },
		{ "b", "Native sliders, dropdowns and checkboxes on every tab, one value per row: up and down move between rows, left and right change the focused value, Cross toggles a checkbox.", 1 },
